  "description": "Linefinder Chassis Builds – No Guesswork, Just Shred-Ready\n\nBeen dreaming about a Linefinder build but stuck on what fork and shock to run? We’ve done the work for you — pairing our Linefinder frameset with premium Fox and RockShox suspension. This is a NO BRAINER.\nGet all the capability and control of our 120mm rear travel Linefinder, now with dialed suspension combos — ready to shred.\n\nROCKSHOX PIKE ULTIMATE 140mm RC2 SILVER\n\nFOX FLOAT X2 FACTORY\n\nSTEM PROTAPER MTB 50x31.8mm POLISHED LTD\n\nROCKSHOX REVERB AXS 31.6mm x 170mm\n\nWhat You Get\n\nLinefinder frame\n\nMatched fork & rear shock\n\nRear axle, headset, seat clamp, stem, dropper post\n\nNote: Bottom bracket and other components not included.\nNOTE: Requires T47 bottom bracket\n\nWhy Linefinder?\n\n120mm Horst Link Rear Travel\n\nUp to 140mm Front Travel\n\n29x2.4\" Tire Clearance\n\nIntegrated Cable Routing\n\nAdjustable Reach",
